{"id":"ff1dddefb4838916","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-right-group-actions.md","title":"Definition — 群的右作用范畴","display":"Definition — 群的右作用范畴","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-right-group-actions","aliases":["14-df-right-group-actions"],"display":"Definition — 群的右作用范畴","source_ref":"I.1, pp.24–28; I, Exercise 5, p.62","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-algebraic-structures]]","[[14-df-category]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-right-group-actions"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-right-group-actions</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 群的右作用范畴"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"I.1, pp.24–28; I, Exercise 5, p.62"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4d1aca1534bd822e\" href=\"?note=4d1aca1534bd822e\" title=\"14-df-algebraic-structures\">14-df-algebraic-structures</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(G\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu,e,\\iota\">\\(\\mu,e,\\iota\\)</span>，满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4d1aca1534bd822e\" href=\"?note=4d1aca1534bd822e\" title=\"14-df-algebraic-structures\">14-df-algebraic-structures</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsGroup}(G,\\mu,e,\\iota)\">\\(\\operatorname{IsGroup}(G,\\mu,e,\\iota)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"gh:=\\mu(g,h)\">\\(gh:=\\mu(g,h)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g^{-1}:=\\iota(g)\">\\(g^{-1}:=\\iota(g)\\)</span>。作用对象写为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K=(X,\\rho)\">\\(K=(X,\\rho)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(X\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:X\\times G\\to X\">\\(\\rho:X\\times G\\to X\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|K|\">\\(|K|\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_K\">\\(\\rho_K\\)</span> 为以下底集、作用投影；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"xg\">\\(xg\\)</span> 简写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_K(x,g)\">\\(\\rho_K(x,g)\\)</span>，所在作用对象由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 的类型决定。箭头严格编码为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(K,L,f)\">\\((K,L,f)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_G\">\\(b_G\\)</span> 提取底层集合函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,L,M\">\\(K,L,M\\)</span> 为作用对象；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O_G,M_G,d_G,c_G,i_G,\\gamma_G\">\\(O_G,M_G,d_G,c_G,i_G,\\gamma_G\\)</span> 为以下范畴数据。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1_G,K\\times_G L\">\\(\\mathbf1_G,K\\times_G L\\)</span> 为选定终对象和二元积，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\times\">\\(\\times\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"BG\">\\(BG\\)</span> 中简写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\times_G\">\\(\\times_G\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"O_G=\\{(X,\\rho)\\mid X\\in\\mathcal U\\land\\rho:X\\times G\\to X\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall g,h\\in G\\;(\\rho(x,e)=x\\land\\rho(\\rho(x,g),h)=\\rho(x,gh))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[O_G=\\{(X,\\rho)\\mid X\\in\\mathcal U\\land\\rho:X\\times G\\to X\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall g,h\\in G\\;(\\rho(x,e)=x\\land\\rho(\\rho(x,g),h)=\\rho(x,gh))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|(X,\\rho)|=X,\\qquad\\rho_{(X,\\rho)}=\\rho\\quad((X,\\rho)\\in O_G).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|(X,\\rho)|=X,\\qquad\\rho_{(X,\\rho)}=\\rho\\quad((X,\\rho)\\in O_G).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M_G=\\{(K,L,f)\\mid K,L\\in O_G\\land f:|K|\\to|L|\\land\\forall x\\in|K|\\;\\forall g\\in G\\;f(\\rho_K(x,g))=\\rho_L(f(x),g)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M_G=\\{(K,L,f)\\mid K,L\\in O_G\\land f:|K|\\to|L|\\land\\forall x\\in|K|\\;\\forall g\\in G\\;f(\\rho_K(x,g))=\\rho_L(f(x),g)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"d_G(K,L,f)=K,\\quad c_G(K,L,f)=L,\\quad b_G(K,L,f)=f,\\quad i_G(K)=(K,K,\\operatorname{id}_{|K|}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[d_G(K,L,f)=K,\\quad c_G(K,L,f)=L,\\quad b_G(K,L,f)=f,\\quad i_G(K)=(K,K,\\operatorname{id}_{|K|}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\gamma_G((L,M,g),(K,L,f))=(K,M,g\\circ f),\\qquad BG=(O_G,M_G,d_G,c_G,i_G,\\gamma_G).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\gamma_G((L,M,g),(K,L,f))=(K,M,g\\circ f),\\qquad BG=(O_G,M_G,d_G,c_G,i_G,\\gamma_G).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG}(K,L)=\\{a\\in M_G:d_G(a)=K\\land c_G(a)=L\\},\\qquad\\mathbf1_G=(\\{*\\},\\{((*,g),*):g\\in G\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG}(K,L)=\\{a\\in M_G:d_G(a)=K\\land c_G(a)=L\\},\\qquad\\mathbf1_G=(\\{*\\},\\{((*,g),*):g\\in G\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"K\\times_G L=(|K|\\times|L|,(((x,y),g)\\mapsto(\\rho_K(x,g),\\rho_L(y,g)))),\\quad\\pi_1^G=(K\\times_G L,K,\\pi_1),\\quad\\pi_2^G=(K\\times_G L,L,\\pi_2).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[K\\times_G L=(|K|\\times|L|,(((x,y),g)\\mapsto(\\rho_K(x,g),\\rho_L(y,g)))),\\quad\\pi_1^G=(K\\times_G L,K,\\pi_1),\\quad\\pi_2^G=(K\\times_G L,L,\\pi_2).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本次显式补全源、靶、恒等和复合六元组；有序对作用对象和三元组箭头不会把同一底集上不同作用误同一。积投影和到单点的唯一函数均等变，逐底集的配对是等变的，故给出所选积和终对象。</p>\n<p>等变函数的恒等和复合仍等变，故给出范畴。把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 看作一个对象的范畴，其箭头是群元素、复合是群乘法，右作用正是该范畴上的反变集合值函子。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"BG\">\\(BG\\)</span> 是本书最基本的预层拓扑斯例子之一。右作用方向已固定，指数中的逆元必须与该方向一致。</p>\n<p>来源：Mac Lane–Moerdijk，I.1, pp.24–28; I, Exercise 5, p.62。此处来源定位沿用所附笔记；本次未获得所列原书文件。数学结构及必要条件以本条 Hypothesis 和 Assertion 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-algebraic-structures","status":"resolved","id":"4d1aca1534bd822e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-algebraic-structures]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-algebraic-structures","status":"resolved","id":"4d1aca1534bd822e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $G\\in\\mathcal U$ 及 $\\mu,e,\\iota$，满足 [[14-df-algebraic-structures]] 的 $\\operatorname{IsGroup}(G,\\mu,e,\\iota)$；$gh:=\\mu(g,h)$、$g^{-1}:=\\iota(g)$。作用对象写为 $K=(X,\\rho)$，其中 $X\\in\\mathcal U$、$\\rho:X\\times G\\to X$。$|K|$、$\\rho_K$ 为以下底集、作用投影；$xg$ 简写 $\\rho_K(x,g)$，所在作用对象由 $x$ 的类型决定。箭头严格编码为 $(K,L,f)$，$b_G$ 提取底层集合函数。$K,L,M$ 为作用对象；$O_G,M_G,d_G,c_G,i_G,\\gamma_G$ 为以下范畴数据。$\\mathbf1_G,K\\times_G L$ 为选定终对象和二元积，$\\times$ 在 $BG$ 中简写 $\\times_G$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G\\in\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu,e,\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsGroup}(G,\\mu,e,\\iota)","display":false},{"tex":"gh:=\\mu(g,h)","display":false},{"tex":"g^{-1}:=\\iota(g)","display":false},{"tex":"K=(X,\\rho)","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho:X\\times G\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"|K|","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho_K","display":false},{"tex":"xg","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho_K(x,g)","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"(K,L,f)","display":false},{"tex":"b_G","display":false},{"tex":"K,L,M","display":false},{"tex":"O_G,M_G,d_G,c_G,i_G,\\gamma_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf1_G,K\\times_G L","display":false},{"tex":"\\times","display":false},{"tex":"BG","display":false},{"tex":"\\times_G","display":false},{"tex":"O_G=\\{(X,\\rho)\\mid X\\in\\mathcal U\\land\\rho:X\\times G\\to X\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall g,h\\in G\\;(\\rho(x,e)=x\\land\\rho(\\rho(x,g),h)=\\rho(x,gh))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"|(X,\\rho)|=X,\\qquad\\rho_{(X,\\rho)}=\\rho\\quad((X,\\rho)\\in O_G).","display":true},{"tex":"M_G=\\{(K,L,f)\\mid K,L\\in O_G\\land f:|K|\\to|L|\\land\\forall x\\in|K|\\;\\forall g\\in G\\;f(\\rho_K(x,g))=\\rho_L(f(x),g)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"d_G(K,L,f)=K,\\quad c_G(K,L,f)=L,\\quad b_G(K,L,f)=f,\\quad i_G(K)=(K,K,\\operatorname{id}_{|K|}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\gamma_G((L,M,g),(K,L,f))=(K,M,g\\circ f),\\qquad BG=(O_G,M_G,d_G,c_G,i_G,\\gamma_G).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG}(K,L)=\\{a\\in M_G:d_G(a)=K\\land c_G(a)=L\\},\\qquad\\mathbf1_G=(\\{*\\},\\{((*,g),*):g\\in G\\}).","display":true},{"tex":"K\\times_G L=(|K|\\times|L|,(((x,y),g)\\mapsto(\\rho_K(x,g),\\rho_L(y,g)))),\\quad\\pi_1^G=(K\\times_G L,K,\\pi_1),\\quad\\pi_2^G=(K\\times_G L,L,\\pi_2).","display":true},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"BG","display":false}],"bytes":2821,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-297","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-right-group-actions|df-197 — 群的右作用范畴]]"},{"id":"b15595c6868517ce","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G\\in\\mathcal U$ 及 $\\mu,e,\\iota,\\tau_G$ 满足 [[14-df-algebraic-structures]] 的 $\\operatorname{IsTopologicalGroup}(G,\\mu,e,\\iota,\\tau_G)$；$X$ 在本原子中表示右 $G$ 作用的底集且取离散拓扑；$(X,\\rho_X)$ 才是 [[14-df-right-group-actions]] 的作用对象。$\\tau_G$ 为 $G$ 的拓扑。乘积拓扑由矩形基给出。稳定子依赖于当前作用对象，精确记为 $\\operatorname{Stab}_G(X,\\rho_X,x)$；$G_x$ 是该参数已绑定时的简称。$BG_{\\mathrm{cts}}$ 为以下定义的满子范畴候选；满子范畴构造见 [[14-df-functor-full-subcategory]]。"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-20","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-right-group-actions]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-145","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-right-group-actions]]"},{"id":"dd3ceef5571a783f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G,\\mu,e,\\iota$ 是 [[14-df-right-group-actions]] 固定的群数据，$X,Y,Z$ 为该条的带作用对象。$|X|,|Y|$ 为底集，$b_G$ 提取箭头的底层函数，$xg=\\rho_X(x,g)$。$h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG}(Z\\times_G X,Y)$，$k\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG}(Z,E)$。$E,\\operatorname{ev},\\Phi,\\Psi$ 为以下构造。"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-85","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-df-right-group-actions]]"},{"id":"d1583fe749649bad","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G\\in\\mathcal U$，给定 $\\mu:G^2\\to G$、$e\\in G$、$\\iota:G\\to G$，满足 [[14-df-algebraic-structures]] 的 $\\operatorname{IsGroup}(G,\\mu,e,\\iota)$；记 $gh=\\mu(g,h)$、$g^{-1}=\\iota(g)$。$BG,\\mathbf1_G,b_G$ 见 [[14-df-right-group-actions]]。$\\Delta G$ 为底集 $G$ 取平凡作用的对象；$T$ 为底集 $G$ 取右正则作用的对象。$\\rho_\\Delta,\\rho_T,m_\\Delta,e_\\Delta,\\iota_\\Delta,\\rho,\\nu$ 为下式构造，乘积均为 $BG$ 的所选对角作用积。"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-299","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-right-group-actions|df-197 — 群的右作用范畴]]"},{"id":"bbce3cb75d3e9dbc","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$G,\\mu,e,\\iota,\\tau_G$ 沿用 [[14-df-continuous-discrete-actions]] 的拓扑群数据。$i:BG_{\\mathrm{cts}}\\to BG$ 为满包含。$X=(|X|,\\rho_X)$、$X'=(|X'|,\\rho_{X'})$ 为任意带作用对象，$f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG}(X,X')$；$b_G$ 见 [[14-df-right-group-actions]]。$X_{\\mathrm{cts}}$ 为下式定义的子集，稳定子精确签名见 [[14-df-continuous-discrete-actions]]。$r$ 是以下定义的函子。$W,Y,Z$ 为连续作用对象，$(-)^{(-)}_{BG}$ 采用 [[14-df-group-action-exponentials]] 的带结构指数。$\\iota_X:X_{\\mathrm{cts}}\\hookrightarrow|X|$ 为集合包含函数；$v\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG}(iY,X)$、$k\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG_{\\mathrm{cts}}}(Y,rX)$。"},{"id":"0e7878d33550867c","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G\\in\\mathcal U$ 及群运算沿用 [[14-df-right-group-actions]] 的完整数据；$BG,\\mathbf1_G,b_G$ 采用该条构造。$X=(|X|,\\rho_X)$ 为作用对象，$A\\subseteq|X|$ 为 $G$ 稳定子集。$\\Omega_G,\\operatorname{true},\\chi_A,\\mathcal S_G(X)$ 为以下构造。"}],"outgoing":["4d1aca1534bd822e","28211adc1b0ce5bc"]}